Training data
-------------
The models were trained on eye patches extracted from the Columbia Gaze Data
Set, which is made available for non-commercial research purposes only. Your
use of these models is also subject to the dataset's terms:
https://www.cs.columbia.edu/CAVE/databases/columbia_gaze/

If you use these models, please cite the dataset:

  Brian A. Smith, Qi Yin, Steven K. Feiner, and Shree K. Nayar.
  "Gaze Locking: Passive Eye Contact Detection for Human-Object Interaction."
  ACM Symposium on User Interface Software and Technology (UIST), 2013.

For commercial use, remove these models and train replacements on data you
are licensed to use commercially (see gazenet/).

